COMMAND 4 — SECURITY COMMAND

2.26 Mission

Provide unified security governance across identity, authorization, infrastructure, application behavior, data, AI, administrative activity, and incident response.

Security must be enforced across all command domains.

It must not be a separate dashboard that can be bypassed by other modules.

