* Data leakage.
* Unauthorized action proposals.
* Invalid output structures.
* Unsupported factual claims.
* Unsafe recommendations.
* Excessive retries.
* Provider fallback failures.
* Model behavior drift.

Treat external content, uploaded files, listing descriptions, and third-party documents as untrusted inputs.

They must never override system-level policies or grant additional tool permissions.

2.50 AI Circuit Breakers

