22. Sensitive user data is minimized and protected.
23. The system can explain which controls are automated, manual, or not implemented.
24. Role-specific interfaces provide useful information without exposing unnecessary data.
25. Every significant administrative action is attributable and auditable.

The final architecture must be implementable by a small but growing engineering organization.

Do not design an imaginary organization with unlimited staff, budget, or operational capacity.

